sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FL as Flutter
    participant H as Handler
    participant AU as AuthUsecase
    participant DS as SessionUsecase
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant RD as Redis

    FL->>H: POST /user/login
    activate H
    H->>AU: Login(email, password)
    activate AU
    AU->>PG: 查用户 · bcrypt 比对
    PG-->>AU: 用户行
    AU->>PG: 签发 access JWT · 写 refresh sha256
    AU-->>H: token + refresh_token
    deactivate AU
    H->>DS: IssueOnLogin(user, device)
    activate DS
    DS->>RD: SET auth:session:{uid}
    DS-->>H: session_id
    deactivate DS
    H-->>FL: 200 三件套凭据
    deactivate H

    Note over FL,RD: 覆盖旧设备 session · bcrypt 失败累加 failed_login_count 并置 locked_until
